OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused says he had 'no
OL,4,Aexcuse' for fatal punch
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murder after fatally
OL,7,Fpunching a pub owner said he had no
OL,8,Fexcuse for the attack and did not know
OL,9,Fwhat came over him.
OL,11,FBilly Allison, 36, has denied murdering
OL,12,FMatthew O'Gara at the Ricco and Loren
OL,13,Fbar in Lichfield on 24 May, but has
OL,14,Fadmitted manslaughter.
OL,16,FStafford Crown Court heard he did not
OL,17,Fintend to seriously injure O'Gara when
OL,18,Fhe delivered a punch with "significant
OL,19,Fforce" to the 44-year-old's neck,
OL,20,Fcausing two broken bones and a split
OL,21,Fartery.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
